{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f4a0f4f2d320c3afe6737ba9c9dadb721c6b15dcdbf24fb0011bc6489206b58e",
      "source_sha256": "075ffc94053c7fbd13e34676f63660d4565edff0effebf1c597746058d794d1a",
      "translation": "复制体……！？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ca4f1887b7bdc01bcf5f88577edd9c9c83473cfff09cbd6c32c36a40c553cf47",
      "source_sha256": "3cbb56e3a1bb439aaf78de80b6cda72aabe099566491e3726d98eca762ed7b77",
      "translation": "当初，不是以为你死了，才制造了二号艾尔加吗？就是同样的道理。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:26cc757f43c710207c3a898b774ff0e88350f9a32385364f2a5b3883ecff8497",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc49b30e217c34b319cb01d3dacc7599230fd82effe0ae17808e2b079f4a3ac1",
      "source_sha256": "c3a66871f2e2e7e2adef4e68105a206bb5f9c96c5f6f10bcba1fc3a659a1f51a",
      "translation": "那、那么……难道，挑起阿维斯贝尔克战争和鲁哈尔特内战的元凶，就是你吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7cb138803da260d2a566b4da16f5595b6a343d2c0d70d84b837e2e37af31604b",
      "source_sha256": "da845fe7a76e4374049da7118360a20b20e66770c057feb3312c3571ff80b384",
      "translation": "不是我，却也可以说是我。因为，那是比我更早诞生的复制体，所做的事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a23fee3d9e84e4f36cf338f35f049e3353e5a3db1c4a0702350dad7c58a155f9",
      "source_sha256": "25cb0903483c3021e3a6650d0223232e8c5d293833d9c32e6f1429abd75a673e",
      "translation": "那你为什么，不代替她牺牲？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0a85d6e6758b2552991df35eee87688ced28f5e10fbb58959b8c3b53c4ed821",
      "source_sha256": "4072ec17a9395ca48541a71e0535a4f2633258328379d69317c9aea2bf9d65be",
      "translation": "如果你是斯特拉斯……那你自己，不就是玛格纳卡尔塔吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f58a4336141fcd277cd22ad62d3abdeddb4e68a057422dc91dd214684a907e87",
      "source_sha256": "0c2d1f145903b31e864602fb0b53393b94d4469a2e8afa6e903acdc3e47ebd12",
      "translation": "遗憾的是，经过不断复制，我体内卡蒙德的能力，已经彻底衰退了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5abb9817d1e165ac9787d47945b4cef6f107a4ef7694a97c242703ac9eda0277",
      "source_sha256": "738968fa32cf4254f327219e4dd47531d21c89fcc31320fda5f265ca9fb2a3c9",
      "translation": "所以，我没能成为……玛格纳卡尔塔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6eabc2cf2eda04b74ae48eeb9aeb0ad007c820013065e3b12977b40db9cdc0ff",
      "source_sha256": "3118adc95e8fb4a1a819a3c8ae579d2d6b6ad08104be8d455bc25612140999a5",
      "translation": "数百年来，被你杀死的人，已经数不胜数。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2027109a6f588004cf9bc281af31b6bd4f2bda4b26ed9278356077a567f68945",
      "source_sha256": "e77330811932c11b94ffedfa1e18220b000efd0fbce6a31c6bdbbca62f1b2875",
      "translation": "真的有必要，不惜做到这种地步，也要把兰兹海姆变成乐园吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ccb7cddb44c2eb16076f583d384a0a963484da631a204a0247746d204d58fcad",
      "source_sha256": "12f5e7749363dd6ce829ae1c5f826ba5814e7a30f1d4d7480650fdb2ea94953d",
      "translation": "那是千年前，由我守护，也是我创造的乐园……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:120f992de2a5713bbfb1b7253d52fca6f484de2612cf4cbac97dbd8ccdae0e05",
      "source_sha256": "f11686bf3e9aef20ab84a3f893c37d81ed8c633eb37b7a33ea8c7f86ae7c96d0",
      "translation": "对于兰兹海姆，我与神明，并无不同。也就是，创造者。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e7a9105cfc23f0a060185599f035c839f69b14082d39204d633bbc07d281a49a",
      "source_sha256": "4e15193c18923a5e5511ce801ec0b96fe40c9f0944cb45f6d1ae6c4cf46dddb7",
      "translation": "要是没有我，兰兹海姆早就毁灭了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ae1424698855434c1582f40713b063a166de0a72bd0f070b1573610e662e440",
      "source_sha256": "d938b4c00de08953dfcc9eedb20fdd392fe2eb8b7096a5774ee950ba8cf38c9e",
      "translation": "所有人都渴望乐园，为什么，你们却要拒绝？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e3eb60379cb9f5d7fbfde1a4a6d3a1af9fa4fb2eed0b0a2c1ad3a971ad749105",
      "source_sha256": "b75061458c36990344a730c7ce585f795a37508306388529dec4c44713e07be1",
      "translation": "那你演说时，为什么不说出真相？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dbbf9865d35eac68a95ae5bd4161afbf2f2b3281894a78532f84513ce7914f3a",
      "source_sha256": "87563034cd53480a51368ddba20908f7233780f28527d5a032d7748a48e52576",
      "translation": "要是知道，那是必须牺牲数万人，才能维持的乐园，所有人真的还会赞同你吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:77788181ef713ee7509e645a1f047cfb8241ca1b18c25af037ae57f95b3051a3",
      "source_sha256": "f29350f6e9f8737d42625f957ad9784525dbaeeb6ec80ce46b5c9909158a1737",
      "translation": "你确实曾在千年前，拯救这个世界。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e1026307a89855e4bbe9d8442e07fe426183f75554ef304b77bc13028e50ac9e",
      "source_sha256": "05929220e43f8b3787ad4cae5c1297ec80ed48751390003d4453dee31313866c",
      "translation": "可是，如今的你，正在走向错误的方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1a619e3b0e1bee32ee99c12426a1df7d4fc1aa644c92e9e06ae6923e26fd3e12",
      "source_sha256": "f93f53f4154bc4d11a92266e3cd8d5e4b65f68698ac84561e13f6e615fe2d97b",
      "translation": "你究竟还要，让无辜的人流血到什么时候？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2a49ad549e5bc02a16fe3f0ec125645902ed0f81fef28aa059c414ca6dc05df8",
      "source_sha256": "70db723dc86aa433a185380b0ca39cb9c629bbccc3b69985f1a35748e3786629",
      "translation": "呵呵，我可不想听，一个逃避死亡的胆小鬼辩解。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:117036922632864512696fcff79ad208681dcebec05958281ff57992c90b03dd",
      "source_sha256": "744da4cc6d7b2fb44362476ff6558b64305aebed646a4d90b5bd89bbe27ca626",
      "translation": "你以为，自己有资格说这种话？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:24f360453863a2027525115b47f7cd21116c210fb5d90f92cc94281cc5255e9b",
      "source_sha256": "9a168dd158f089ec795c3def027fbc3b089ff8a3bb4719b628b1ad712a6e9608",
      "translation": "洁菲死了，世界就能得救吗？只会让牺牲，不断重演！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:073990aa2f3c31aad4ff1cfef60dd4a401665198b930461ea80f3182dc6a98fc",
      "source_sha256": "dc08404cd6810e73f92fb0ac07624ee324e34e2f528b93fbca4d74905bdc35d7",
      "translation": "这可怕的代价，到底还要支付多久？直到兰兹海姆的人类，彻底消失吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8d818ece47720846518e1a41cc95ffed2d9ddc5d442b4f9563d7807822b1d36d",
      "source_sha256": "9ef1b9ab51ecc96a121fc0cd258038c596ff7c50da3a88c6f9ce007363a6d944",
      "translation": "呵，够了。我本来就没指望，能和你们讲通道理。拔剑吧！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ead5d0a5a1493a3c34f2529e4df87ea2f6f4fb8eb17e5e1aa4798738b6fbd0df",
      "source_sha256": "3990879b6878488ad294999a02de8fc76aefc354b0306f76db5c1caaed21de7d",
      "translation": "好，正合我意。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a2c7d466142db59eb5a7d69763a640928aadf10213d0f3ee89c9dd0d81f7fa23",
      "source_sha256": "a49e3e59855294eb1272b91423710c6f3b96d4d3640ebfce7fddd0da87d437e2",
      "translation": "摧毁拉·斯特拉达后……就再也享受不到KAN的恩惠。也就是说，KAN循环会消失。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f21dc6068b9981cdc724da9ba491c2892988f8809562665684feef9f6b7890ca",
      "source_sha256": "ce68a37c9af0d0fab6e72768e48ad03e07ce1190f6a20cc3b3501cef3066df70",
      "translation": "你知道……那意味着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:88a1d082970411069104aba499eec82b6047b1ca4c3db62bdfe81177913c7458",
      "source_sha256": "f24d18b1ef4425f45c43af34ad2135d6b7bcbd6bed51e92a6e1e6411ecd39bda",
      "translation": "播下种子，就立刻发芽、结果的奇迹，将不复存在。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4777fb566f8c2412027e44e086747ab671c9f156d50ada0edd5fbadc40b24acc",
      "source_sha256": "e19638ef28b52c402c22b1db50473a8fd4a0df02274b95494ff9f0649886470a",
      "translation": "一直沉浸在福泽中，懒散度日的人们，真能忍受严酷的劳作吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae921c63a921c63b29ef51091356787eb10a2ea3ab9c86a8b63e54b1e256526e",
      "source_sha256": "bd88e287a10631c50cb32a44036bff5ac5f64c0b7a182e23f580020ed41bc264",
      "translation": "而且，若是连环术也消失，病人将得不到妥善治疗，在痛苦中死去吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9cd4710ac59d81a9fc57df91595768a4487b9c3c8a4bdf5dd7489959895b86c0",
      "source_sha256": "70e513a82cf1bfbc8cf153c756cea99cfab60877567663e4b16297a92da378b7",
      "translation": "卡尔玛会停止运作。而且……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2733eb2656aeb9f2cfa346f5176de94a00a2d369b21f369fc3abb6267638e22f",
      "source_sha256": "49639a0e215abe8414a0d03d7b186d5b65e64ceacec6d68d0a43efa5e2ae5447",
      "translation": "到头来，连哨兵……也会停止活动。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f538d94d99e16a556cd9b9ad07b847885eeb545d6e775b43e299957cd6b9fc2",
      "source_sha256": "1e70db3cacf543264fad2b8cef1e62373b0a939b16ca6501c98fdddfff547635",
      "translation": "难道说！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c752ac425a0291680d61cdae470e2da410edaa26e3792c3aac54d3f869b332e7",
      "source_sha256": "d6bdcf37ee725359ebb015ad643f63bbf0cf7d4582cce1fe0525bde72b182699",
      "translation": "是啊，你猜到了吗……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d8afa97d87ec2b7825aa99131c8be0c419cfa7cea88f4127b74ca6293ee97fa9",
      "source_sha256": "7ed9ff3bf7e517a66cb6e4711dfad8427f296ef1f558d70c2b4ba62653199f1a",
      "translation": "哨兵，是通过血之契约这种连环术，被赋予生命的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4447f4018ff518893524a21e48dedb11f4083ac504227e575d88791893f2a8b7",
      "source_sha256": "b8e78931f93e9de7e2850346696912ab32e82697fe42c79e2a1ed850edee0768",
      "translation": "如果，那种连环术的效果消失，会怎么样呢？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c08b4317afa7b4a7267c965fd3e0f80d60714e15eca567b9d639b5ebec067c00",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9ee73d7bcb5f7030a60dd396aeb3b7bffe9c60ee6ace19f4e84554d2c5c7e1fa",
      "source_sha256": "a5908196da4a708776748b4308a9a055ca607d05b0e6cdf7d9f3fede6640d4b0",
      "translation": "答案显而易见。如果拉·斯特拉达消失，你会变成什么样，心里很清楚吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:971ff395ef68a925a71796f8f97e85cdf4052b941c4bdd848898d9fcd9c29f4d",
      "source_sha256": "4e0a540a457ce59ab78c371ab75085d35296b111c6ec7ab565fa681ca8ee0ba2",
      "translation": "即使如此，你还是要摧毁拉·斯特拉达吗？"
    }
  ]
}
